  "changes": [
    "Shared explicitly qualified machine-height calibration with a positive uniform native-source scale.",
    "Arsenal fixed giant-camera frame now covers the admitted Hind rotor phases and projected tail-rotor envelope; moving the player never changes its framing.",
    "Archive seven exact-incarnation encounters use one fixed world-to-screen transform for actors, targets, contact bodies, ports, bullets and particles.",
    "Archive Gekko3, Walker4 and Dwarf20 use equal source scale within each incarnation and geometry-based spacing on one floor. Moving Dwarf contact uses its own unit identity and replaces its static instance.",
    "Archive Hind alternates two independent admitted left-facing rocket-pod sources.",
    "Original MGS1 M1 beam slot becomes a native-mouth ballistic cannon round. Original MGS2 Harrier inherited beams/volleys become ballistic bursts from the native left underside gun pod.",
    "Harrier gun pod is an additional untouched-atlas crop with a qualified ventral attachment and fixed bore axis. No missile rails or speculative joints are introduced.",
    "One read-only alpha16 record measures the new pod crop; all871 previous ink-record values and lexical bytes are retained."
  ],
